cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: >-
  If you use op_infer or its flepimop2 provider, please cite this software
  as an unreleased development checkout and record the exact commit and any
  local changes used in your methods.
type: software
title: "op_infer: the statistical layer of the op stack"
abstract: >-
  Provenance-bound forward and posterior records, a bounded catalog of
  independent scalar or fixed-shaped iid priors and observation laws,
  calibration and design workflows, and native adapters for declared subsets
  of mature inference libraries, with a separately distributed flepimop2
  provider.
authors:
  - family-names: Macdonald
    given-names: Joshua
    email: jmacdo16@jh.edu
version: "0.0.1"
license:
  - MIT
  - GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/ACCIDDA/op_infer"
keywords:
  - Bayesian inference
  - simulation-based calibration
  - identifiability
  - experimental design
